      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get that, but it's literally just a burning sensation like i ate something spicy. i dont want to go to the doctor for every little thing, it's expensive and i'm pretty sure it's just reflux. if i take a double dose of Tums or maybe some of my wife's indigestion meds, would that be enough to clear it up for good? i really just want to fix it at home.",
