      "content": "look man i'm not trying to be difficult but im 58 and i've had indigestion for years. it's always just been a bit of a burn after eating or moving around. honestly it just feels like my stomach is acting up. if i just take a large dose of an antacid now, like maybe 4 or 5 calcium carbonate tablets at once, will that help get rid of this pressure feeling so i can just sleep it off? i really don't want to deal with an ER visit if it's just gas or acid.",
